# Sales Performance Dashboard

## Project Overview

This project is an interactive **Sales Performance Dashboard** developed using **Microsoft Power BI** to analyze sales performance and business KPIs.

## Key Performance Indicators (KPIs)

- Total Revenue: 991.75K
- Total Profit: 364.88K
- Profit Margin: 36.79%
- Total Orders: 1.44K

## Dashboard Features

- Revenue and profit analysis
- Sales trend analysis
- Product performance analysis
- Regional sales analysis
- Customer segment analysis
- Sales channel analysis
- Sales representative performance
- Interactive filters and slicers

## Tools & Technologies

- Microsoft Power BI
- SQL / MySQL
- Microsoft Excel
- Data Visualization
- Business Intelligence

## Project Objective

The objective of this project is to analyze sales data, identify business trends, and present meaningful insights through an interactive dashboard.

## Project Files

- Power BI Dashboard (.pbix)
- Sales Dataset (.csv)
- SQL Queries (.sql)

